      "comment": "Narzissenkreuz: Rene and the Ritual of Rebirth",
      "content": "Rene chose to be the \"first subject\" and have his personality removed so that a purer being might emerge. The ritual used the Holy Blade and part of Lyris's essence but left him bodiless; Jakob then built the body that carried his mind and called it Narzissenkreuz.",
