      ],
      "comment": "Narzissenkreuz: The World-Formula",
      "content": "The calculation predicts that the world's birthing waters will run dry and that a flood hundreds of years later will ruin the world. Jakob describes the apocalypse as the second deluge, which the wiki equates with the Prophecy of Fontaine. Narzissenkreuz is credited with using it to make the Doomsday Clock. The Traveler's arrival changed the values in it.",
