      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Waking from the Great Dream",
        "Genesis of a Certain Micro-Universe"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Narzissenkreuz",
        "Primordial Sea"
      ],
      "comment": "Narzissenkreuz: Waking from the Great Dream",
      "content": "The fight takes place in the Primordial Sea. Narzissenkreuz demands the Holy Blade and says he will save as many as he can even at the cost of his life force. He calls the Traveler someone equal to a world, then admits defeat. Ann tells him she is willing to forgive him, and he apologises.",
