      "key": [
        "Caterpillar"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Narzissenkreuz",
        "Ordo",
        "Master"
      ],
      "comment": "Narzissenkreuz: Caterpillar",
      "content": "Caterpillar was a hilichurl rogue given human intelligence and speech by the Master, then confined in the Fortress of Meropide after a failed task. Earlier, Jakob's Hydro Eidolons had held a humanoid form, and one sentient being lived only 32 days before dissolving.",
