      "key": [
        "Annapausis"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Narzissenkreuz",
        "Rene",
        "Mary-Ann"
      ],
      "comment": "Narzissenkreuz: Annapausis and Mary-Ann",
      "content": "In Annapausis, a dream-like place held together by Mary-Ann's will, he steps forward and admits who he is. Mary-Ann forgives Rene, withholds forgiveness from Narzissenkreuz, and invites him to travel. He declines, saying there is still something he must do.",
